C: x0 CREATE x-custom
S: x0 OK \[MAILBOXID \(.+\)\] CREATE completed.

C: x0 XLIST "" "x-custom"
S: \* XLIST \(\\HasNoChildren\) \"\.\" "x-custom"
S: x0 OK XLIST completed.

C: x0 LIST "" "x-custom" RETURN (SPECIAL-USE)
S: \* LIST \(\\HasNoChildren\) \"\.\" "x-custom"
S: x0 OK LIST completed.

C: x0 LIST (SPECIAL-USE) "" "x-custom"
S: x0 OK LIST completed.

C: x1 CREATE x-
S: x1 OK \[MAILBOXID \(.+\)\] CREATE completed.

C: x1 XLIST "" "x-"
S: \* XLIST \(\\HasNoChildren\) \"\.\" "x-"
S: x1 OK XLIST completed.

C: x1 LIST "" "x-" RETURN (SPECIAL-USE)
S: \* LIST \(\\HasNoChildren\) \"\.\" "x-"
S: x1 OK LIST completed.

C: x1 LIST (SPECIAL-USE) "" "x-"
S: x1 OK LIST completed.

C: x2 CREATE X-custom
S: x2 OK \[MAILBOXID \(.+\)\] CREATE completed.

C: x2 XLIST "" "X-custom"
S: \* XLIST \(\\HasNoChildren\) \"\.\" "X-custom"
S: x2 OK XLIST completed.

C: x2 LIST "" "X-custom" RETURN (SPECIAL-USE)
S: \* LIST \(\\HasNoChildren\) \"\.\" "X-custom"
S: x2 OK LIST completed.

C: x2 LIST (SPECIAL-USE) "" "X-custom"
S: x2 OK LIST completed.
